/**
 * The homepage hero: the A.J. Marksberry mark, the fish and the waves, from
 * Figma (AJM Portfolio 2026 - 2027, node 8281:18389), as inline SVG.
 *
 * It plays once on load, in order: the name is written, then the title, then
 * "with a fishing habit", then the front wave rolls in, the fish starts to rise
 * out from behind it, and the middle and back waves come in quickly after that.
 * Then the three waves keep swaying, one after another, for as long as the page
 * is open. The timing lives in globals.css (.hero-art).
 *
 * There are two layouts of the same drawing. From 640px up it is the Figma
 * frame as designed. On a phone that frame would shrink the title to about 11px
 * tall, so below 640px a taller layout is used instead: the name fills the
 * width, the title tucks in beside the J, the tagline sits under it, and the
 * fish and waves follow underneath, running off both edges of the screen.
 *
 * The shapes are defined once, in a hidden sprite, and both layouts point at
 * them with <use>, so the path data is not in the page twice. Coordinates are
 * the Figma frame's own, 1367 x 858, rounded to one decimal.
 *
 * The mark follows the theme (dark ink on light, light on dark); the waves and
 * the title keep the Figma colors.
 */
